{%- comment -%}
PFC Compass — ONE chosen commitment per refresh: a value, an area statement,
a vision, or a life question, cycling by the clock. These are near-static by
nature, which is exactly why rotation carries them: a file re-read once a
year is invisible; a different line every fifteen minutes is not.

The builder picks the item AND its typography tier (text_size: giga for a
two-word value, large for a sentence, base for a long statement). Templates
only display it.

E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles — framework classes only.
{%- endcomment -%}
